		Heading 1:
			Text: Named colors
		Paragraph: `Named color` declares a color once in `Styles`, with a name and its value. The name then goes wherever a color goes: `Color`, `Border color`, `Background` (also inside a gradient) and `Separator color`. Changing the palette is changing these lines.
